{"id":8833348534471,"title":"Custom Celtic Tree of Life Quilt Set with Fantasy Central Eye Artwork","handle":"custom-tree-of-life-quilt-set-yggdrasil-celtic-patterns-908827b1df-908827b1df","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace the ancient symbolism and mythical beauty of the Tree of Life with this Custom Quilt Set by Jeminise. Featuring an intricate design inspired by fantasy mythology and Yggdrasil, this soft bedding set offers lightweight warmth for the summer and cozy comfort during the winter. Perfectly suited for nature lovers, this custom-made quilt enhances any farmhouse or rustic bedroom decor while providing year-round versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalized Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize your quilt with unique text options or special requests to make a truly personalized bedding piece or heartfelt gift.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoft \u0026amp; Cozy Material:\u003c\/strong\u003e Made from 100% breathable polyester with a soft outer fabric layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for maximum comfort.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Seasonal Comfort:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designed to offer lightweight warmth in the summer and cozy insulation during the winter seasons.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMulti-Functional Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Perfect as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, decorative picnic mat, or camping blanket.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable fabric that dries quickly and resists pilling, fading, and wrinkling over time.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOptional Pillowcases:\u003c\/strong\u003e Complete your custom bedding set by selecting the option to include matching pillowcases.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ctable\